$set_ans_13 = Compute("{0, 7, 8, 12, 15, 19} U (((7, infinity)))");
$set_ans_14 = Compute("(-infinity, 11) U ((-infinity, 11) U ((-infinity, 11) U ((-infinity, 11)))) U ((7, infinity) U (7, infinity)) U ((7, infinity))");
$set_ans_11 = Compute("[3, infinity) U ({2, 15})");
$set_ans_12 = Compute("[3, infinity) U [3, infinity) U [3, infinity) U [3, infinity)");
$set_ans_8 = Compute("[6, infinity) U ([6, infinity) - ((-infinity, infinity) - {4, 7, 10, 11, 18, 19})) U [6, infinity)");
$set_ans_9 = Compute("{4, 7, 10, 11, 18, 19} U [6, infinity) U {6, 10, 13, 14, 15}");
$set_ans_10 = Compute("{4, 7, 10, 11, 18, 19} - ((-infinity, infinity) - [6, infinity)) - ((-infinity, infinity) - {4, 7, 10, 11, 18, 19})");
$set_ans_5 = Compute("{3, 7, 8, 13, 15} U {3, 7, 8, 13, 15} U ({1, 2, 12, 15, 17})");
$set_ans_6 = Compute("{1, 2, 12, 15, 17} U {3, 7, 8, 13, 15} U {1, 2, 12, 15, 17} - ((-infinity, infinity) - (({3, 7, 8, 13, 15}) U ({3, 7, 8, 13, 15}) - ((-infinity, infinity) - {3, 7, 8, 13, 15}))) U {1, 2, 12, 15, 17} U {1, 2, 12, 15, 17}");
$set_ans_7 = Compute("({1, 2, 12, 15, 17}) U ({3, 7, 8, 13, 15} - ((-infinity, infinity) - {3, 7, 8, 13, 15})) U {3, 7, 8, 13, 15} - ((-infinity, infinity) - {3, 7, 8, 13, 15}) U {3, 7, 8, 13, 15} U {3, 7, 8, 13, 15}");
$set_ans_3 = Compute("(4, 10) U [6, infinity)");
$set_ans_4 = Compute("([6, infinity) U {6, 9, 11, 15, 17}) U {6, 9, 11, 15, 17} U (4, 10)");
$set_ans_1 = Compute("(6, infinity) U (-infinity, 13]");
$set_ans_2 = Compute("({3, 7}) U (({3, 7} - ((-infinity, infinity) - (((6, infinity) U (6, infinity))))))");

BEGIN_PGML
# Questions:

_For arithmetic problems, if the result is not an integer, then retain *three significant digits*._

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{x | x > 5\}`]
- [`B = \{x | x \leq 13\}`]
- [`C = \{3, 7\}`]

Compute:
- [`A \cup B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_1}
- [`(C) \cup ((C \cap ((A \cup A)))) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_2}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{x | x \geq 6\}`]
- [`B = \{x | 4 < x < 10\}`]
- [`C = \{6, 9, 11, 15, 17\}`]

Compute:
- [`B \cup A = `] [_____]{$set_ans_3}
- [`(A \cup C) \cup C \cup B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_4}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{1, 2, 12, 15, 17\}`]
- [`B = \{3, 7, 8, 13, 15\}`]

Compute:
- [`B \cup B \cup (A) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_5}
- [`A \cup B \cup A \cap ((B) \cup (B) \cap B) \cup A \cup A = `] [_____]{$set_ans_6}
- [`(A) \cup (B \cap B) \cup B \cap B \cup B \cup B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_7}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{x | x \geq 6\}`]
- [`B = \{4, 7, 10, 11, 18, 19\}`]
- [`C = \{6, 10, 13, 14, 15\}`]

Compute:
- [`A \cup (A \cap B) \cup A = `] [_____]{$set_ans_8}
- [`B \cup A \cup C = `] [_____]{$set_ans_9}
- [`B \cap A \cap B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_10}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{2, 15\}`]
- [`B = \{x | x \geq 3\}`]

Compute:
- [`B \cup (A) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_11}
- [`B \cup B \cup B \cup B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_12}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{x | x > 6\}`]
- [`B = \{0, 7, 8, 12, 15, 19\}`]
- [`C = \{x | x < 11\}`]

Compute:
- [`B \cup ((A)) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_13}
- [`C \cup (C \cup (C \cup (C))) \cup (A \cup A) \cup (A) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_14}

---
END_PGML
